wer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "b6d7a1bb-2b22-5fcb-95fb-9f44edd34200" :answer-field/choices "ea5e3f07-99ff-540a-9cb5-d65bfdb3deaa"] [:db/add "b6d7a1bb-2b22-5fcb-95fb-9f44edd34200" :answer-field/choices "e43f83e7-80cb-56df-b32b-9031973aa5a3"] [:db/add "b6d7a1bb-2b22-5fcb-95fb-9f44edd34200" :answer-field/choices "755143cd-5ed9-5e1b-8d5b-5cda84267c28"] [:db/add "b6d7a1bb-2b22-5fcb-95fb-9f44edd34200" :answer-field/choices "ff22cf23-2c43-5d63-aaa0-e07be7fbd843"] [:db/add "b6d7a1bb-2b22-5fcb-95fb-9f44edd34200" :answer-field/choices "2ed763b1-4372-543e-8ee2-dcc84046626c"] [:db/add "b6d7a1bb-2b22-5fcb-95fb-9f44edd34200" :answer-field/correct "ea5e3f07-99ff-540a-9cb5-d65bfdb3deaa"] [:db/ensure "b6d7a1bb-2b22-5fcb-95fb-9f44edd34200" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8d27d9cf-cb74-5840-b365-e7db0c04fb39" :question/id #uuid "8d27d9cf-cb74-5840-b365-e7db0c04fb39"] [:db/add "8d27d9cf-cb74-5840-b365-e7db0c04fb39" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{6}} \\frac{7}{\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "8d27d9cf-cb74-5840-b365-e7db0c04fb39" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=3 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=(3)(0)=0 \\\\ x=\\frac{1}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=(3)(\\frac{1}{6})=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth transformed endpoints lie strictly between $-1$ and $1$, so the integrand is continuous throughout the interval.\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{6}} \\frac{7}{\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 7\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{6}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(3 x)^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 7(\\frac{1}{3})\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{3}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{3}[\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{3}(\\operatorname{arcsin}(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{3}((\\frac{\\pi}{6})-(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\pi}{18}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "8d27d9cf-cb74-5840-b365-e7db0c04fb39" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "8d27d9cf-cb74-5840-b365-e7db0c04fb39" :question/answer-fields "b6d7a1bb-2b22-5fcb-95fb-9f44edd34200"] [:db/ensure "8d27d9cf-cb74-5840-b365-e7db0c04fb39" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "8d27d9cf-cb74-5840-b365-e7db0c04fb39"] [:db/add "d36c10cf-131b-534c-8641-5d5e441d82eb" :answer/id #uuid "d36c10cf-131b-534c-8641-5d5e441d82eb"] [:db/add "d36c10cf-131b-534c-8641-5d5e441d82eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d36c10cf-131b-534c-8641-5d5e441d82eb" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "d36c10cf-131b-534c-8641-5d5e441d82eb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5802f692-c0cd-5a7e-897b-1371d250ef1e" :answer/id #uuid "5802f692-c0cd-5a7e-897b-1371d250ef1e"] [:db/add "5802f692-c0cd-5a7e-897b-1371d250ef1e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5802f692-c0cd-5a7e-897b-1371d250ef1e" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{24}"] [:db/ensure "5802f692-c0cd-5a7e-897b-1371d250ef1e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c7a337d6-4b80-5385-bb22-efe782a80c7b" :answer/id #uuid "c7a337d6-4b80-5385-bb22-efe782a80c7b"] [:db/add "c7a337d6-4b80-5385-bb22-efe782a80c7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c7a337d6-4b80-5385-bb22-efe782a80c7b" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "c7a337d6-4b80-5385-bb22-efe782a80c7b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cdc8d03a-17cc-5e50-9b8a-ab499d73cb11" :answer/id #uuid "cdc8d03a-17cc-5e50-9b8a-ab499d73cb11"] [:db/add "cdc8d03a-17cc-5e50-9b8a-ab499d73cb11" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cdc8d03a-17cc-5e50-9b8a-ab499d73c