ution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=(6)(0)=0 \\\\ x=\\frac{1}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=(6)(\\frac{1}{6})=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{6}} \\frac{8}{36 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 8\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{6}} \\frac{1}{1+(6 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 8(\\frac{1}{6})\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{3}\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{3}[\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{0}^{1} \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{3}(\\operatorname{arctan}(1)-\\operatorname{arctan}(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{3}((\\frac{\\pi}{4})-(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "a497f451-04d7-5c60-a172-42abdf02370f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "a497f451-04d7-5c60-a172-42abdf02370f" :question/answer-fields "c0d68d01-8a42-57ff-b972-69003f4877c2"] [:db/ensure "a497f451-04d7-5c60-a172-42abdf02370f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "a497f451-04d7-5c60-a172-42abdf02370f"] [:db/add "3658debc-c4b0-50eb-b768-7e1015c693c4" :answer/id #uuid "3658debc-c4b0-50eb-b768-7e1015c693c4"] [:db/add "3658debc-c4b0-50eb-b768-7e1015c693c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3658debc-c4b0-50eb-b768-7e1015c693c4" :answer/value "\\frac{6 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}}{7}"] [:db/ensure "3658debc-c4b0-50eb-b768-7e1015c693c4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "297649ef-44df-588e-b84f-acc835a9587d" :answer/id #uuid "297649ef-44df-588e-b84f-acc835a9587d"] [:db/add "297649ef-44df-588e-b84f-acc835a9587d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "297649ef-44df-588e-b84f-acc835a9587d" :answer/value "\\frac{6 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}}{49}"] [:db/ensure "297649ef-44df-588e-b84f-acc835a9587d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "093ea6db-39b4-540d-abdb-9f769f0d4190" :answer/id #uuid "093ea6db-39b4-540d-abdb-9f769f0d4190"] [:db/add "093ea6db-39b4-540d-abdb-9f769f0d4190" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "093ea6db-39b4-540d-abdb-9f769f0d4190" :answer/value "6 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "093ea6db-39b4-540d-abdb-9f769f0d4190" :answer/validate] [:db/add "59ced480-f5f7-5e7c-b714-da8fe15e0eec" :answer/id #uuid "59ced480-f5f7-5e7c-b714-da8fe15e0eec"] [:db/add "59ced480-f5f7-5e7c-b714-da8fe15e0eec" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "59ced480-f5f7-5e7c-b714-da8fe15e0eec" :answer/value "\\frac{36 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}}{7}"] [:db/ensure "59ced480-f5f7-5e7c-b714-da8fe15e0eec" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dee94e97-9107-57cf-8abb-af0261012ca6" :answer/id #uuid "dee94e97-9107-57cf-8abb-af0261012ca6"] [:db/add "dee94e97-9107-57cf-8abb-af0261012ca6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dee94e97-9107-57cf-8abb-af0261012ca6" :answer/value "- \\frac{6 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}}{7}"] [:db/ensure "dee94e97-9107-57cf-8abb-af0261012ca6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/id #uuid "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32"] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/choices "3658debc-c4b0-50eb-b768-7e1015c693c4"] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/choices "297649ef-44df-588e-b84f-acc835a9587d"] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/choices "093ea6db-39b4-540d-abdb-9f769f0d4190"] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/choices "59ced480-f5f7-5e7c-b714-da8fe15e0eec"] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/choices "dee94e97-9107-57cf-8abb-af0261012ca6"] [:db/add "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/correct "3658debc-c4b0-50eb-b768-7e1015c693c4"] [:db/ensure "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "24b61c76-ca28-5b5c-9a6e-51d22a7f675a" :question/id #uuid "24b61c76-ca28-5b5c-9a6e-51d22a7f675a"] [:db/add "24b61c76-ca28-5b5c-9a6e-51d22a7f675a" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{14}} \\frac{6}{49 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "24b61c76-ca28-5b5c-9a6e-51d22a7f675a" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=7 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=7,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{7})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=(7)(0)=0 \\\\ x=\\frac{1}{14}&\\Longrightarrow u=(7)(\\frac{1}{14})=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{14}} \\frac{6}{49 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 6\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{14}} \\frac{1}{1+(7 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 6(\\frac{1}{7})\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{6}{7}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{6}{7}[\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\  &= \\frac{6}{7}(\\operatorname{arctan}(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arctan}(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{6}{7}((\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)})-(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{6 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}}{7}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "24b61c76-ca28-5b5c-9a6e-51d22a7f675a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "24b61c76-ca28-5b5c-9a6e-51d22a7f675a" :question/answer-fields "39a7f2e1-904a-5576-a7b2-3a71b7ec4a32"] [:db/ensure "24b61c76-ca28-5b5c-9a6e-51d22a7f675a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "24b61c76-ca28-5b5c-9a6e-51d22a7f675a"] [:db/add "3e664b4d-38a8-5ddc-9c88-53307ae3c5bd" :answer/id #uuid "3e664b4d-38a8-5ddc-9c88-53307ae3c5bd"] [:db/add "3e664b4d-38a8-5ddc-9c88-53307ae3c5bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3e664b4d-38a8-5ddc-9c88-53307ae3c5bd" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\pi}{15}"] [:db/ensure "3e664b4d-38a8-5ddc-9c88-53307ae3c5bd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "aa4440e7-6f62-5402-bbe0-f2650309cdb7" :answer-field/id #uuid "aa4440e7-6f62-5402-bbe0-f2650309cdb7"] [:db/add "aa4440e7-6f62-5402-bbe0-f2650309cdb7" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "aa4440e7-6f62-5402-bbe0-f2650309cdb7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "aa4440e7-6f62-5402-bbe0-f2650309cdb7" :answer-field/choices "3e664b4d-38a8-5ddc-9c88-53307ae3c5bd"] [:db/add "aa4440e7-6f62-5402-bbe0-f2650309cdb7" :answer-field/correct "3e664b4d-38a8-5ddc-9c88-53307ae3c5bd"] [:db/ensure "aa4440e7-6f62-5402-bbe0-f2650309cdb7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a2d73b9e-ded5-5263-8f8f-f603b91d7e83" :question/id #uuid "a2d73b9e-ded5-5263-8f8f-f603b91d7e83"] [:db/add "a2d73b9e-ded5-5263-8f8f-f603b91d7e83" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{10}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "a2d73b9e-ded5-5263-8f8f-f603b91d7e83" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=5 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=(5)(0)=0 \\\\ x=\\frac{1}{10}&\\Longrightarrow u=(5)(\\frac{1}{10})=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth transformed endpoints lie strictly between $-1$ and $1$, so the integrand is continuous throughout the interval.\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{10}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 4\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{10}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(5 x)^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 4(\\frac{1}{5})\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}[\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}(\\operatorname{arcsin}(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}((\\frac{\\pi}{6})-(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\pi}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "a2d73b9e-ded5-5263-8f8f-f603b91d7e83" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "a2d73b9e-ded5-5263-8f8f-f603b91d7e83" :question/answer-fields "aa4440e7-6f62-5402-bbe0-f2650309cdb7"] [:db/ensure "a2d73b9e-ded5-5263-8f8f-f603b91d7e83" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "a2d73b9e-ded5-5263-8f8f-f603b91d7e83"] [:db/add "2a0125b7-63f0-5ffe-9867-939dcd35b2af" :answer/id #uuid "2a0125b7-63f0-5ffe-9867-939dcd35b2af"] [:db/add "2a0125b7-63f0-5ffe-9867-939dcd35b2af" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2a0125b7-63f0-5ffe-9867-939dcd35b2af" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "2a0125b7-63f0-5ffe-9867-939dcd35b2af" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e3ea9054-3361-5bd8-b506-dcb0dcac388a" :answer-field/id #uuid "e3ea9054-3361-5bd8-b506-dcb0dcac388a"] [:db/add "e3ea9054-3361-5bd8-b506-dcb0dcac388a" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "e3ea9054-3361-5bd8-b506-dcb0dcac388a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e3ea9054-3361-5bd8-b506-dcb0dcac388a" :answer-field/choices "2a0125b7-63f0-5ffe-9867-939dcd35b2af"] [:db/add "e3ea9054-3361-5bd8-b506-dcb0dcac388a" :answer-field/correct "2a0125b7-63f0-5ffe-9867-939dcd35b2af"] [:db/ensure "e3ea9054-3361-5bd8-b506-dcb0dcac388a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a7b41060-9701-5ac8-9406-41c43c4a9895" :question/id #uuid "a7b41060-9701-5ac8-9406-41c43c4a9895"] [:db/add "a7b41060-9701-5ac8-9406-41c43c4a9895" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{9}} \\frac{9}{81 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "a7b41060-9701-5ac8-9406-41c43c4a9895" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=9 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=9,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{9})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=(9)(0)=0 \\\\ x=\\frac{1}{9}&\\Longrightarrow u=(9)(\\frac{1}{9})=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{9}} \\frac{9}{81 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 9\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{9}} \\frac{1}{1+(9 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 9(\\frac{1}{9})\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1[\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{0}^{1} \\\\  &= 1(\\operatorname{arctan}(1)-\\operatorname{arctan}(0)) \\\\  &= 1((\\frac{\\pi}{4})-(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "a7b41060-9701-5ac8-9406-41c43c4a9895" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "a7b41060-9701-5ac8-9406-41c43c4a9895" :question/answer-fields "e3ea9054-3361-5bd8-b506-dcb0dcac388a"] [:db/ensure "a7b41060-9701-5ac8-9406-41c43c4a9895" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "a7b41060-9701-5ac8-9406-41c43c4a9895"] [:db/add "2759c9ed-11ea-57ee-a0bd-9ad257122f12" :answer/id #uuid "2759c9ed-11ea-57ee-a0bd-9ad257122f12"] [:db/add "2759c9ed-11ea-57ee-a0bd-9ad257122f12" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2759c9ed-11ea-57ee-a0bd-9ad257122f12" :answer/value "\\frac{5}{9}"] [:db/ensure "2759c9ed-11ea-57ee-a0bd-9ad2571