{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=9,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{9})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=(9)(0)=0 \\\\ x=\\frac{2}{9}&\\Longrightarrow u=(9)(\\frac{2}{9})=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{0}^{\\frac{2}{9}} \\frac{5}{81 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 5\\int_{0}^{\\frac{2}{9}} \\frac{1}{1+(9 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 5(\\frac{1}{9})\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{9}\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{9}[\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{0}^{2} \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{9}(\\operatorname{arctan}(2)-\\operatorname{arctan}(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{9}((\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(2 \\right)})-(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{5 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(2 \\right)}}{9}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "d5ffb59e-2be0-5b32-8138-13035a607668" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "d5ffb59e-2be0-5b32-8138-13035a607668" :question/answer-fields "8fcc298a-078c-5c60-b6a2-c6d4172da034"] [:db/add "d5ffb59e-2be0-5b32-8138-13035a607668" :question/answer-fields "e5f1fd37-720c-5104-aaf1-071e70b68d8c"] [:db/ensure "d5ffb59e-2be0-5b32-8138-13035a607668" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "d5ffb59e-2be0-5b32-8138-13035a607668"] [:db/add "5f917a32-7963-5d6f-afcc-c9a117beb131" :answer/id #uuid "5f917a32-7963-5d6f-afcc-c9a117beb131"] [:db/add "5f917a32-7963-5d6f-afcc-c9a117beb131" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5f917a32-7963-5d6f-afcc-c9a117beb131" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\pi}{16}"] [:db/ensure "5f917a32-7963-5d6f-afcc-c9a117beb131" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dbaa1cec-9fad-5c4c-9b41-008695f4e480" :answer/id #uuid "dbaa1cec-9fad-5c4c-9b41-008695f4e480"] [:db/add "dbaa1cec-9fad-5c4c-9b41