n/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=6 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{6})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=(6)(0)=0 \\\\ x=\\frac{1}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=(6)(\\frac{1}{2})=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{8}{36 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 8\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{1+(6 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 8(\\frac{1}{6})\\int_{0}^{3} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{3}\\int_{0}^{3} \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{3}[\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{0}^{3} \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{3}(\\operatorname{arctan}(3)-\\operatorname{arctan}(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{3}((\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(3 \\right)})-(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(3 \\right)}}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "7f635271-ad06-57ec-ba14-197476f846bc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "7f635271-ad06-57ec-ba14-197476f846bc" :question/answer-fields "708a5c04-84ae-5fc7-8d2f-1654bd8d1621"] [:db/ensure "7f635271-ad06-57ec-ba14-197476f846bc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "7f635271-ad06-57ec-ba14-197476f846bc"] [:db/add "1af8cc77-0bac-5940-b352-f949e5f99a1a" :answer/id #uuid "1af8cc77-0bac-5940-b352-f949e5f99a1a"] [:db/add "1af8cc77-0bac-5940-b352-f949e5f99a1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1af8cc77-0bac-5940-b352-f949e5f99a1a" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{15}"] [:db/ensure "1af8cc77-0bac-5940-b352-f949e5f99a1a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ee451c8-40b1-5552-b4a2-16770a8b9dcd" :answer-field/id #uuid "0ee451c8-40b1-5552-b4a2-16770a8b9dcd"] [:db/add "0ee451c8-40b1-5552-b4a2-16770a8b9dcd" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "0ee451c8-40b1-5552-b4a2-16770a8b9dcd" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0ee451c8-40b1-5552-b4a2-16770a8b9dcd" :answer-field/choices "1af8cc77-0bac-5940-b352-f949e5f99a1a"] [:db/add "0ee451c8-40b1-5552-b4a2-16770a8b9dcd" :answer-field/correct "1af8cc77-0bac-5940-b352-f949e5f99a1a"] [:db/ensure "0ee451c8-40b1-5552-b4a2-16770a8b9dcd" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b8833921-cd55-5d33-86f3-5cb87a7b71f5" :question/id #uuid "b8833921-cd55-5d33-86f3-5cb87a7b71f5"] [:db/add "b8833921-cd55-5d33-86f3-5cb87a7b71f5" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{10}} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "b8833921-cd55-5d33-86f3-5cb87a7b71f5" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=5 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=(5)(0)=0 \\\\ x=\\frac{1}{10}&\\Longrightarrow u=(5)(\\frac{1}{10})=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth transformed endpoints lie strictly between $-1$ and $1$, so the integrand is continuous throughout the interval.\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{10}} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 2\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{10}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(5 x)^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 2(\\frac{1}{5})\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{2}{5}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{2}{5}[\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\  &= \\frac{2}{5}(\\operatorname{arcsin}(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{2}{5}((\\frac{\\pi}{6})-(0)) \\\\  &= \\frac{\\pi}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "b8833921-cd55-5d33-86f3-5cb87a7b71f5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "b8833921-cd55-5d33-86f3-5cb87a7b71f5" :question/answer-fields "0ee451c8-40b1-5552-b4a2-16770a8b9dcd"] [:db/ensure "b8833921-cd55-5d33-86f3-5cb87a7b71f5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "b8833921-cd55-5d33-86f3-5cb87a7b71f5"] [:db/add "77ebe17d-2513-5cde-ae28-8040113f8496" :answer/id #uuid "77ebe17d-2513-5cde-ae28-8040113f8496"] [:db/add "77ebe17d-2513-5cde-ae28-8040113f8496" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "77ebe17d-2513-5cde-ae28-8040113f8496" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6} \\pi}{9}"] [:db/ensure "77ebe17d-2513-5cde-ae28-8040113f8496" :answer/validate] [:db/add "759e5427-78c7-5cb9-aa97-0a52c8ecd3d1" :answer/id #uuid "759e5427-78c7-5cb9-aa97-0a52c8ecd3d1"] [:db/add "759e5427-78c7-5cb9-aa97-0a52c8ecd3d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "759e5427-78c7-5cb9-aa97-0a52c8ecd3d1" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "759e5427-78c7-5cb9-aa97-0a52c8ecd3d1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "33b3be47-676e-5ece-9ce1-37cd7674fbcd" :answer/id #uuid "33b3be47-676e-5ece-9ce1-37cd7674fbcd"] [:db/add "33b3be47-676e-5ece-9ce1-37cd7674fbcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "33b3be47-676e-5ece-9ce1-37cd7674fbcd" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\sqrt{6} \\pi}{9}"] [:db/ensure "33b3be47-676e-5ece-9ce1-37cd7674fbcd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2afd7b19-eca2-5ee6-b883-ba3c32d3c286" :answer/id #uuid "2afd7b19-eca2-5ee6-b883-ba3c32d3c286"] [:db/add "2afd7b19-eca2-5ee6-b883-ba3c32d3c286" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2afd7b19-eca2-5ee6-b883-ba3c32d3c286" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{9}"] [:db/ensure "2afd7b19-eca2-5ee6-b883-ba3c32d3c286" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3684568f-217d-59ef-b6af-389c35869a89" :answer/id #uuid "3684568f-217d-59ef-b6af-389c35869a89"] [:db/add "3684568f-217d-59ef-b6af-389c35869a89" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3684568f-