\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int_{- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{10}}{5}}^{\\frac{2 \\sqrt{30}}{5}} \\frac{6}{\\sqrt{64 - 10 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{3}{4}\\int_{- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{10}}{5}}^{\\frac{2 \\sqrt{30}}{5}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{8})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{3}{4}(\\frac{4 \\sqrt{10}}{5})\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\sqrt{10}}{5}\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\sqrt{10}}{5}[\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\sqrt{10}}{5}(\\operatorname{arcsin}(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}(- \\frac{1}{2})) \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\sqrt{10}}{5}((\\frac{\\pi}{3})-(- \\frac{\\pi}{6})) \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\sqrt{10} \\pi}{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "31069773-e2d9-58b9-845a-c488f05a3fd1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "31069773-e2d9-58b9-845a-c488f05a3fd1" :question/answer-fields "15535d36-569d-5a66-912f-4328e0b08515"] [:db/ensure "31069773-e2d9-58b9-845a-c488f05a3fd1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "31069773-e2d9-58b9-845a-c488f05a3fd1"] [:db/add "8f897da0-c7c7-5ad7-bec0-4f2425e87fbe" :answer/id #uuid "8f897da0-c7c7-5ad7-bec0-4f2425e87fbe"] [:db/add "8f897da0-c7c7-5ad7-bec0-4f2425e87fbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8f897da0-c7c7-5ad7-bec0-4f2425e87fbe" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\sqrt{7} \\pi}{140}"] [:db/ensure "8f897da0-c7c7-5ad7-bec0-4f2425e87fbe" :answer/validate] [:db/add "420aac5e-015a-5dcf-96c2-aa80b9e6f176" :answer/id #uuid "420aac5e-015a-5dcf-96c2-aa80b9e6f176"] [:db/add "420aac5e-015a-5dcf-96c2-aa80b9e6f176" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "420aac5e-015a-5dcf-96c2-aa80b9e6f176" :answer/value "- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{7} \\pi}{140}"] [:db/en